      "The image shows a scenic riverside view with a metal truss bridge crossing over a river. There is a steamboat docked by the shore, forested hills in the background, and some small wooden buildings and logs in the foreground. The caption on the lower left says 'Bergeforsen', and on the lower right 'Indalselfven'. There is handwritten text at the bottom."
